When [[Grier]] returned to the island and defeated [[Zan-Gason]], Sutos' governor recognized him as Prince Zan-Grier and handed him an [[Amulet]] containing the [[Titan]], [[Megataur]]. The governor, along with other inhabitants of Sutos Island, tried to stop [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]] from attacking Grier's [[Suits]]. {{source|Like Father, Unlike Son}}

The governor was present when the Huntik team returned to Sutos asking for Grier's help against [[Rassimov]] and the [[Blood Spiral]]. {{source|An Ally from the Organization}}
